  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Midnight Study",
    "overview": "The Midnight Study is quiet and welcoming for beginners. Dark, closely related surfaces make space for card artwork and reading notes. Familiar controls and clear edges help readers move through a spread at their own pace.",
